# Binary media: never normalize line endings or show text diffs.
*.mp4  binary
*.webm binary
*.mov  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.exe  binary

# Git LFS is intentionally NOT enabled. GitHub Pages (legacy deploy from
# master) serves LFS pointer files instead of the real content, which would
# break every public URL of a tracked file. Large media goes to GitHub
# Releases instead. See docs/maintenance/history-cleanup.md.
# Enable only after moving the deploy to an Actions workflow that checks out
# with `lfs: true`:
# *.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.wav filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
